#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:141
msgid ""
"A channel change is applied immediately: the bot rewrites servers.yaml "
"and starts using the new channel at once, with no restart."
msgstr "频道更改会立即生效：机器人会改写 servers.yaml 并立刻开始使用新频道，无需重启。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:220
msgid "Server name"
msgstr "服务器名称"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:221
msgid ""
"Renamed by the bot, not by the file: a rename moves the server (its "
"instance folder and its servers.yaml entry) and rewrites the channel "
"names and messages that carry the old name."
msgstr "由机器人而非文件来重命名：重命名会移动服务器（其实例文件夹及其 servers.yaml 条目），并改写带有旧名称的频道名称和消息。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:224
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:225
msgid ""
"A brief description, shown in /status and in the server list. The Discord"
" editor allows up to 2000 characters."
msgstr "一段简短描述，显示在 /status 和服务器列表中。Discord 编辑器最多允许 2000 个字符。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:227
msgid "Server port"
msgstr "服务器端口"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:228
msgid ""
"The UDP port DCS listens on. The Discord editor takes a 5-digit value "
"here. A port another server on this node already uses is refused, naming "
"it."
msgstr "DCS 监听的 UDP 端口。Discord 编辑器在此处接受 5 位数值。若该端口已被此节点上的另一台服务器使用，则会被拒绝，并指出该服务器。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:231
#: services/webservice/templates/login.html:131
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:703
msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:232
msgid ""
"The DCS password a client needs to join. The field shows the stored "
"password: leave it as it is to keep it, empty it to remove it, type in it"
" to set a new one."
msgstr "客户端加入所需的 DCS 密码。该字段显示已存储的密码：保持不变即可保留，清空即可移除，输入即可设置新密码。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:235
msgid "Maximum number of players"
msgstr "最大玩家数"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:236
msgid ""
"The slot count DCS advertises. The Discord editor takes up to three "
"digits here, which is where the 999 ceiling comes from."
msgstr "DCS 公布的席位数。Discord 编辑器在此处最多接受三位数字，这就是 999 上限的由来。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:238
msgid "Public server"
msgstr "公开服务器"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:239
msgid "Lists the server in the public DCS server browser."
msgstr "将服务器列入公开的 DCS 服务器浏览器。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:240
msgid "Resume mode"
msgstr "恢复模式"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:241
msgid "What DCS does when the last client leaves and when a mission loads."
msgstr "当最后一个客户端离开以及载入任务时，DCS 的行为。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:243
msgid "Maximum allowed ping"
msgstr "允许的最大延迟"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:244
msgid ""
"Values above 300 tend to cause lags / desyncs (the editor's own words). 0"
" turns the check off."
msgstr "高于 300 的数值往往会导致卡顿/失步（编辑器自己的说法）。0 表示关闭该检查。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:246
msgid "Server can screenshot"
msgstr "服务器可以截图"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:247
