msgstr "允许对象导出"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:267
msgid "DCS's export switch for third-party tooling that reads the mission state."
msgstr "DCS 的导出开关，供读取任务状态的第三方工具使用。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:269
msgid "Allow sensor export"
msgstr "允许传感器导出"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:270
msgid "DCS's export switch for sensor data."
msgstr "DCS 的传感器数据导出开关。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:271
msgid "Allow ownship export"
msgstr "允许本机导出"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:272
msgid "DCS's export switch for the player's own aircraft."
msgstr "DCS 的玩家本机导出开关。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:273
msgid "Allow players pool"
msgstr "允许玩家池"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:274
msgid "Players nobody slots are held in a pool instead of leaving."
msgstr "没有分配到席位的玩家会被保留在池中，而不是离开。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:275
msgid "Disable all events"
msgstr "禁用所有事件"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:276
msgid ""
"Turns DCS's own mission events off. The bot's event-driven plugins see "
"nothing while it is on."
msgstr "关闭 DCS 自身的任务事件。启用期间，机器人的事件驱动插件什么也看不到。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:290
msgid ""
"The missions DCS cycles through, in order. Managed by the mission "
"autoscan and validated at boot — a bad path is a boot failure — so this "
"tab does not edit it."
msgstr "DCS 按顺序轮换的任务列表。由任务自动扫描管理，并在启动时校验——路径错误会导致启动失败——因此此标签页不编辑它。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:319
msgid "Blue coalition password"
msgstr "蓝方阵营密码"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:320
msgid ""
"The password a client picks to join the blue side. The bot stores it and "
"asks DCS to apply it."
msgstr "客户端加入蓝方时选择的密码。机器人会存储它并要求 DCS 应用它。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:321
msgid "Red coalition password"
msgstr "红方阵营密码"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:322
msgid ""
"The password a client picks to join the red side. The bot stores it and "
"asks DCS to apply it."
msgstr "客户端加入红方时选择的密码。机器人会存储它并要求 DCS 应用它。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:340
msgid ""
"A coalition password can be changed while the server is running, paused "
"or stopped: the bot sends it to DCS and keeps the cleartext in its "
"database."
msgstr "服务器运行、暂停或停止时都可以更改阵营密码：bot 会将其发送给 DCS，并把明文保存在自己的数据库中。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:345
msgid ""
"A password is set outside DCSServerBot — the bot knows only its hash. "
"Type a new one to replace it."
msgstr "密码是在 DCSServerBot 之外设置的 — 机器人只知道它的哈希值。输入新密码即可替换它。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:350
msgid ""
"The bot knows this password but DCS currently carries no hash for it — "
"saving here sets it in DCS too."
msgstr "机器人知道此密码，但 DCS 目前没有它的哈希值 — 在此处保存也会在 DCS 中设置它。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:355
msgid ""
"The coalition passwords can only be changed while the server is shutdown,"
" stopped, running or paused. Wait for it to settle, then edit here."
msgstr "只有当服务器已关闭、已停止、正在运行或已暂停时才能更改阵营密码。等它稳定后再在这里编辑。"

#: services/webservice/readmodels/serverconfig.py:373
msgid ""
"The server must be stopped to change its configuration. Stop it on the "
"Servers page, then edit here."
msgstr "必须停止服务器才能更改其配置。请在 Servers 页面上停止它，然后在这里编辑。"

